(target: Review Agent, both lenses)
This diff contains Ansible content (roles, playbooks, collections,
or plugins). Verify FQCN (fully qualified collection names) on
all module calls — bare module names are deprecated. Check that
`rejectattr()`, `selectattr()`, `map()`, and `filter()` results
are piped through `| list` before passing to other filters
(generator vs list incompatibility across Ansible versions). Do
NOT use Jinja2 templates in role defaults for dynamic data —
role defaults are evaluated at load time, before tasks run; use
`set_fact` for dynamic values instead. Verify idempotency —
tasks should produce no changes on second run. Check that
`ansible_operator_meta` is not accessed for `.spec` or `.status`
(it only contains name, namespace, kind — use `k8s_info` for
full CR data).
